<view class="page secondary-page pending-page">
  <view class="status-icon"><image src="/assets/icons/warehouse-active.png" mode="aspectFit" /></view>
  <view class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT REGISTERED</view><view class="heading">等待管理员授权</view>
  <view class="subtitle">已完成微信身份认证。</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">{{name || '微信仓库账号'}}</view><view class="account-number" wx:if="{{accountId}}">账号编号 <text selectable>#{{accountId}}</text></view>
    <view class="notice">当前账号尚无仓库权限。请将账号编号告知管理员，在电脑端「账号管理」找到你的账号，分配角色并授权。</view>
    <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
    <button class="primary" bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">刷新授权状态</button>
  </view>
  <view class="muted">授权后刷新即可进入工作台。</view>
</view>
